# LENS DESIGN SYSTEM — MANDATORY

This project EXCLUSIVELY uses Lens (`@loomhq/lens@12.14.0`) by Loom.

## Quick Reference
- Full component docs: @.lens-knowledge-base/components.md
- Styles/tokens docs: @.lens-knowledge-base/styles.md
- All exports: @.lens-knowledge-base/exports-inventory.json

## Layout Components
- `<Container>` = generic container (NOT Box, NOT div)
- `<Split>` = flexbox layout (NOT Flex, NOT Stack)
- `<Arrange>` = CSS grid layout (NOT Grid)
- `<Align>` = content positioning
- `<Spacer>` = spacing between elements
- `<SplitSection>` = flex item with grow/shrink/basis

## Typography — ALL text through Text component
- `<Text size="heading-lg" htmlTag="h1">` for headings
- `<Text size="body-md">` for body text
- `<Text variant="mainTitle">` for page titles
- NO separate Heading component exists

## Key API Differences from Other Libraries
- Boolean props: `isDisabled`, `isFloating`, `hasLoader`, `hasEllipsis`
- Element override: `htmlTag="a"` (NOT `as="a"`)
- Refs: `refHandler={(r) => ref.current = r}` (NOT `ref={ref}`)
- Icons: `<Icon icon={<SvgName />} />` with `Svg` prefix
- Spacing: named tokens `"small"/"medium"/"large"` (NOT numbers like `"4"`)
- Button icons: `iconBefore` / `iconAfter` (NOT `leftIcon` / `rightIcon`)

## Spacing Tokens
xsmall=4px, small=8px, medium=16px, large=24px, xlarge=40px, xxlarge=64px
